&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The GenAI Enablement Tribe is where HelloFresh&#39;s transformation into an AI-native company gets engineered: the platform every team builds on, the embedded engineering that redesigns commercial functions end-to-end, that changes how 5,000 knowledge workers and 1,000 engineers actually work. You will lead four teams across Berlin and Warsaw, with a mandate that spans every function in the group (not just tech).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the engineering leadership team, with decision authority, direct access to group leadership, and the room to shape the strategy you then deliver; reporting directly to Ingmar Krusch (SVP Engineering).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that GenAI can change the way people eat forever - this will be your open-ended mission!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI platform ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the platform the whole group builds on: LLM gateway, MCP gateway, agent platform, plugin marketplace, spec-driven development tooling, evals, and agent observability. Shorten the path from idea to running.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward-deployed engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead embedded engineers into marketing, HR, finance, and operations, redesigning each function&#39;s processes AI-native rather than simply automating them, shipping against a business KPI that function owns, and generalising each build back into the platform so the next team starts from a working pattern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Group-wide capability build:&lt;/strong&gt; Build GenAI proficiency across the whole of HelloFresh through curriculum, cohorts, and per-function enablement paths measured on demonstrated skill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy into roadmap: &lt;/strong&gt;Co-create the group GenAI strategy with global central functions leadership, collaborate with the Product org to convert it into a sequenced delivery roadmap, and own the budget and investment decisions across tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and engineering standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and develop Engineering Managers and Staff Engineers across Berlin and Warsaw, holding teams accountable for delivery, engineering standards, and team health, while scaling AI-native working practices into BAU.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and cost:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep adoption safe and affordable by owning guardrails, evals, model routing, cost control, and the compliance boundary with Security, Legal, and Procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering leadership depth:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in software engineering and 5+ years leading Engineering Managers across more than one discipline, with a track record of holding teams accountable for delivery and technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic systems experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have designed, built, and shipped agentic systems with your own hands and teams, and you understand where they fail: context engineering, tool calling, agent orchestration, retrieval, and evaluation harnesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform adoption record:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built internal platforms that engineers adopted, and you can distinguish a platform team that ships features from one that removes friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change beyond the build:&lt;/strong&gt; You have led a transformation programme, a large enablement effort, or a function-wide process redesign that held after you moved on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder credibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You are credible in a design review, and you have guided senior stakeholders through decisions they were initially sceptical about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology strategy ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You have owned technology or AI strategy at an organisation or business unit level, including build vs. buy decisions, with the sequencing that takes pilots into production. You bring low ego, high ownership, and clarity over complexity to the decisions you hold.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you: In your application, be specific about what you personally built and led, what broke, and where you have gone beyond a technical build. If you have set technology strategy above team level and GenAI is the step you are ready to take, say so.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal kit discount: Enjoy a discount on HelloFresh meal kits, delivered straight to your door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension: Build for the long-term with our company pension scheme (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing memberships: Benefit from discounted memberships with Urban Sports Club and John Reed, yoga classes, and access to Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: Balance work and life with flexible hours, Work From Home/Abroad options, and a home office setup budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Childcare support: Financial support for childcare costs (not available for interns/working students).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutschlandticket: A monthly allowance toward the Deutschlandticket for sustainable commuting across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development: Access to internal training programmes and a central L&amp;amp;D budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office and social: Work from a modern office in Berlin-Kreuzberg with team outings, Friday beers, and company events throughout the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? &lt;/strong&gt;If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you. We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#Engineering&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is committed to the principles of equal employment opportunity and providing reasonable accommodations to candidates with disabilities. If you need an accommodation during the application process, please reach out to us at:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Europe: ----- ----- States: ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fender Musical Instruments Corporation&lt;/strong&gt; is a world-famous brand with offices across the globe. Fender was born in Southern California and has built a worldwide influence beyond the studio and the stage. A Fender is more than an instrument; it’s a cultural symbol that resonates globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Purpose of the Job: &lt;/strong&gt;As part of our growing software development team, we are seeking an experienced and motivated &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer II, Applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp; The Software Engineer works on a wide and diverse range of projects including desktop and mobile music creation and host applications, plug-ins and virtual instruments. Familiarity with music technology hard and software will ensure that the Software Developer understands the technical requirements and challenges of our products and solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Functions: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science or Software Engineering or similar education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of working experience in application software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to writing clean, maintainable code within an established architecture, following defined coding standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent object-oriented C++ programming skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing with a cross-platform software framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing connections to remote server and cloud APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with software development tools (Visual Studio, Xcode, Git, CMake, Jira / Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work alone and as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time, task and resource organisation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to take responsibility and be the driving force of a project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a cross-platform software framework such as Qt or JUCE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of digital audio workstation (DAW) software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of VST/AU plug-in technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in music or music production/audio technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fender Musical Instruments:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fender Musical Instruments Corporation (FMIC) is one of the world’s leading musical instrument manufacturers, marketers and distributors, whose portfolio of brands includes Fender®, Squier®, PreSonus®, Gretsch®, Jackson®, EVH®, Charvel®, Bigsby®, and Groove Tubes®, among others. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fender.com/&quot;&gt;www.fender.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideally in Vienna, but anywhere in Spain, Sweden, Poland or Germany also works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; English (mandatory); Swedish, Spanish, German, or French is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years in similar roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €60,000 – €70,000 gross annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Tax Compliance for Millions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they never notice it. We&#39;re the company behind compliance at the point of sale and e-invoicing — the invisible layer that keeps receipts tamper-proof, fights tax fraud, and helps merchants across Europe ditch paper for good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s B2B, it&#39;s regulatory, and yes, it&#39;s complex. But our mission is simple: make tax compliance easy for everyone. If you want to build the infrastructure that quietly powers commerce for millions — you&#39;re in the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;European fiscalization and e-invoicing are fragmented, technical and deadline-driven. Every country has its own rules, its own timelines and its own competitive dynamics. Our buyers: POS manufacturers, PMS and ERP vendors, retailers, resellers&amp;nbsp; are not tax experts, and they do not want to become them. They want to know what a mandate means for them and what to do about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That translation is your job. You will own positioning and messaging for our products across markets, drive go-to-market for new launches and country expansions, and turn dense regulatory requirements into value propositions that land with a technical partner in Munich and a retail chain in Madrid alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with a wide surface area. You will work closely with Product, Compliance, Demand Gen, Content, Sales and our country teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product positioning and messaging for fiskaly&#39;s fiscalization and e-invoicing products (SIGN, RECEIPT, E-INVOICE, SAFE) across multiple European markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and continuously sharpen our ICPs and buyer personas, POS manufacturers, retailers, resellers, PMS and ERP vendors, and equip Demand Gen with the segmentation, pain points and messaging they need to convert them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive go-to-market strategy for new product launches and country/regulation expansions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex regulatory and technical requirements into clear, accurate value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain sales enablement material, battlecards, one-pagers, demo scripts with Sales and Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive intelligence and market research across the fragmented European compliance landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed market and customer signal into the product roadmap in partnership with Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep messaging consistent across DACH, Spain, Italy and our other country teams, with an ear for local nuance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply the Content team with ideas at scale and shape campaign concepts with Demand Generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track regulatory calendars (KassenSichV, RKSV, Verifactu, NF525, and what comes next)&amp;nbsp; these are effectively our market events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in B2B SaaS product marketing, ideally in regulated/compliance, fintech or infrastructure software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record positioning a technically complex or regulated product for buyers who are not experts in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product launches and GTM plans you have owned end to end — not contributed to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of positioning and messaging frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing messaging across multiple countries and languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on sales enablement content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with competitive intelligence tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written English and the ability to make complexity feel simple without losing accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, shifting regulatory timelines and briefs that are not fully formed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultural sensitivity across DACH, Southern Europe and the Nordics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fiscalization, tax-tech, payments, or POS/retail tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Swedish, German, French, Spanish or Italian in addition to English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside legal or compliance functions on customer-facing messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that gives you space to grow, take ownership, and learn from trying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year if you&#39;re based in Austria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid work setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows, Linux, or Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that values clarity, well-being, and good work over noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨ Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work on real problems that have impact, not vanity projects. Our team is pragmatic, direct, and focused on building solid tech for an industry that needs it. We care about how things work, not how they look on paper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that resonates, you’ll probably enjoy working here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Europe, or hybrid from one of our hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;140&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;201&quot; data-end=&quot;215&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English, plus at least one of German, Italian, Spanish or French at native level. Further languages are a real advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;314&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years in outbound sales roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;352&quot; data-end=&quot;398&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;352&quot; data-end=&quot;363&quot;&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €38,000 – €45,000 gross annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;🚀 Join fiskaly! Help Us Simplify Receipts for Millions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;703&quot;&gt;Millions of people interact with fiskaly every day, even if they don’t realize it. As a B2B company, we power the retail technology behind digital receipts and secure, legally compliant transactions.&amp;nbsp;In Italy, we help retailers go fully digital and eliminate the need for hardware like fiscal printers to issue and manage receipts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;By making receipts tamper-proof through digital signatures, we help fight tax fraud. And with our paperless receipt solution, we offer consumers a modern alternative while helping merchants streamline their operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Sure, our solutions sound complex but our mission is simple: make receipts easy for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;💼 The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:137;1149-1285&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll drive new business: POS vendors, software agencies and retail tech providers who need fiscal compliance built into their product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:266;1287-1552&quot;&gt;This is an outbound-heavy role, but we do it the smart way. You won&#39;t spend hours manually researching email addresses. You&#39;ll use sales intelligence and AI tools to build targeted lists, craft hyper-personalised outreach and get in front of decision-makers faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:74;1554-1627&quot;&gt;Your job is to build a qualified pipeline that fuels our European growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;🛠️ What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:175;1652-1826&quot;&gt;Run a high-volume, high-quality outbound motion, identifying and contacting decision-makers — CTOs, Product Managers, Heads of Product — at software companies across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:91;1827-1917&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle for mid-market accounts, and qualification for enterprise deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:148;1918-2065&quot;&gt;Use AI writing assistants and sales intelligence tools (LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Apollo) to research prospects and personalise outreach at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:137;2066-2202&quot;&gt;Run discovery calls that get to the real technical and commercial pain — why the current integration is failing, and what it&#39;s costing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:89;2203-2291&quot;&gt;Work with Marketing to sharpen messaging so the value proposition lands in your market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:60;2292-2351&quot;&gt;Keep impeccable CRM hygiene so forecasting stays accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-35:56;2352-2407&quot;&gt;Represent fiskaly at retail-tech events across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2153&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;👀 What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-45:79;2431-3198&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:102;2431-2532&quot;&gt;5+ years in outbound sales or business development (SDR / BDR / AE), ideally in SaaS or retail tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:105;2533-2637&quot;&gt;Fluent English — it&#39;s our working language and how you&#39;ll operate with HQ and colleagues across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:134;2638-2771&quot;&gt;Native-level command of at least one other European language, because you&#39;ll be selling to software companies in their own language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:114;2772-2885&quot;&gt;A hunter mentality, with a track record of building your own pipeline and hitting outreach targets consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;43:1-43:86;2886-2971&quot;&gt;Tech-savvy: comfortable in a modern sales stack, and eager to use AI to move faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:148;2972-3119&quot;&gt;Curiosity: you grasp technical concepts quickly. You don&#39;t need to be a developer, but you need to understand why an API beats a physical printer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:79;3120-3198&quot;&gt;A proactive, organised approach — you create leads rather than wait for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;47:1-47:20;3200-3219&quot;&gt;🌍 Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-51:60;3221-3515&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:136;3221-3356&quot;&gt;Additional European languages. Every extra one widens the set of prospects you can open and the colleagues you can work with directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-50:99;3357-3455&quot;&gt;Experience selling into more than one European market, or to companies expanding internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:60;3456-3515&quot;&gt;Exposure to regulated or compliance-driven software sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2723&quot; data-end=&quot;2741&quot;&gt;✅ What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2873&quot; data-end=&quot;3275&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2873&quot; data-end=&quot;2951&quot;&gt;A team that gives you space to grow, take ownership, and learn from trying&lt;/li&gt;
