&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2293 - Director, Commerce Delivery &amp;amp; Capability (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Commerce Delivery &amp;amp; Capability Director (UK) is a senior leadership role responsible for how commerce is executed and scaled across the UK business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns the end-to-end delivery model across retail media activation and embedded commerce teams, ensuring consistent, high-quality execution across all clients. It is accountable for building the systems, standards, and capabilities required to deliver performance and enable scalable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in close partnership with the VP, Commerce UK and VP, Commerce Strategy &amp;amp; Consultancy, this role ensures commerce strategies and solutions are effectively operationalised and embedded within client organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own the commerce delivery model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and lead the end-to-end commerce delivery model across activation and embedded teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standards for execution excellence across all clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivery is consistent, scalable, and aligned to client objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Lead activation at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own all retail media activation (onsite and offsite)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance excellence across optimisation, pacing, reporting, and QA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure campaigns are executed effectively, efficiently, and to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Build capability and systems for scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement operating models, playbooks, and delivery standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capability frameworks and training programmes across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive consistency, efficiency, and quality across all delivery functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Drive integration across channels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure commerce is fully embedded within wider media execution (search, social, programmatic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with cross-channel teams to deliver joined-up activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable connected execution across platforms and disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own performance and governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and track performance benchmarks and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve delivery risks, inefficiencies, and gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed a culture of continuous improvement and operational rigour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Influence client outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with VP Commerce UK to support client performance and growth agendas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to client conversations where execution and delivery are critical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure delivery aligns to commercial objectives and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP, Commerce UK – client priorities, commercial direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VP, Commerce Strategy &amp;amp; Consultancy – strategy definition and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth (UK &amp;amp; EMEA) – pitch support and execution input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wider media teams – cross-channel integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior leader with a track record of scaling commerce or media delivery functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in retail media activation and platform execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building operating models, standards, and scalable systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly structured, with a focus on execution excellence and consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to translate strategy into practical, high-performing delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible in senior client environments, particularly on performance and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clearly defined and embedded commerce delivery model across the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent, high-quality execution across all clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable systems, standards, and capability frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong integration of commerce into wider media execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved performance, efficiency, and client outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
