&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Digital Logic Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some familiarity with HDL languages (e.g. Verilog, SystemVerilog) and simulation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
